<title>USA: NPC closes part of acquisition.</title>
<headline>NPC closes part of acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURG, Kan. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>NPC International Inc said Friday it completed the acquisition of 74 Pizza Hut units and the operations of eight others from Jamie Coulter, a franchisee, for $47 million.</p>
<p>The company also will manage 18 units in North Carolina for a period of up to 30 days pending the satisfaction of certain contingencies, after which it expects to acquire the units for $10 million.</p>
<p>NPC is the world's largest Pizza Hut franchisee and now operates 626 Pizza Hut restaurants and delivery kitchens in 21 states.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
